<title>SPAIN: TABLE - Spain May producer prices rose 0.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Spain May producer prices rose 0.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute gave the following figures:</p>
<p> PRODUCER PRICES		  MAY 97	APRIL 97   MAY 96</p>
<p> Pct change on month		0.1	    0.2	0.1</p>
<p> Pct change on year		 0.8	    0.8	1.5</p>
</text>
